/**
 * Bundled studio backdrops: a surface the product stands on, with a wall
 * behind it. The images are generated by `tools/make_backdrops.py` from noise
 * functions (no photos, no AI), so they carry no third-party rights and work
 * offline with no quota.
 *
 * Every image is 9:16 (1296 x 2304). The surface meets the wall at
 * BACKDROP_SURFACE_Y of the height, and the product's base belongs at
 * BACKDROP_BASE_Y (the same placement `productPlacement` in cloud-rules.ts
 * uses for AI scenes).
 */
